# 🔹 File Modes

| Mode        | Description    |
| ----------- | -------------- |
| os.O_RDONLY | Read Only      |
| os.O_WRONLY | Write Only     |
| os.O_RDWR   | Read and Write |
| os.O_APPEND | Append Data    |
| os.O_CREATE | Create File    |

